        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS \r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nEXTENDED 3 BED 2 BATH SEMI DETACHED FAMILY HOME WITH ATTIC ROOM \r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER MATURE DEVELOPMENT\r\nIDYLLIC SETTING \r\nFULLY RENOVATED THROUGHOUT WITH AN EXCELLENT ENERGY RATING \r\nWEST FACING BACK GARDEN \r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED \r\n\r\nA lovely home in a great location....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Glasnevin Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this beautiful home to the Glasnevin property market.\r\n\r\nThe spacious extended floor plan of No. 41 consists of: Entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining room, utility / pantry and shower room.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there is a landing, 3 bedrooms to include primary & family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThere is also a fully converted attic room.\r\n\r\nThe features of this lovely home include: Quality flooring throughout, contemporary fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage,\r\ndoors from dining area leading to garden and quality tiling & sanitary ware in both bathrooms.\r\n\r\nThe property further boasts gas fired central heating and double glazed windows. The property has optimum levels of insulation throughout and has had a full re wire and a full re plumb.\r\n\r\nOutside there is a garden and driveway to the front of the property leading to side entrance. To the rear is a mature lawned west facing garden. \r\n\r\n\r\nThere are a wealth of amenities quite literally on your doorstep to include: Shops, parks, church, recreational facilities and sports clubs.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools and DCU is within a 25 minute walk. \r\n\r\nFinglas, Phibsboro & Santry Villages together with The Charlestown Shopping Centre & Omni Shopping Centre are all close by.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
